"""Translation-unit compile check for runtime/cfsysline.c in the checkout.

The container lacks libestr/libfastjson development packages, so the rsyslog
autotools build cannot run. This wrapper compiles the *real* affected
translation unit (all rsyslog headers verbatim from the checkout) against
minimal local stubs for the two missing external headers, producing an object
file and verifying that doGetChar() is present.

It also compiles the unpatched target blob (read via git) and compares the
generated machine code for the setter call to confirm the candidate passes the
character pointer rather than the character value.

